1
00:00:47,160 --> 00:00:48,620
The Lord's wife was right.

2
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:50,330
Most of the guards are gone.

3
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:51,730
They all went to the South Heaven Gate to intercept her.

4
00:00:51,730 --> 00:00:53,430
Shut up and be careful not to expose yourself.

5
00:00:53,430 --> 00:00:54,430
Stick to the plan.

6
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:55,560
Take two men to set a fire on the east side

7
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:57,060
to distract the remaining guards.

8
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:58,500
I'll go to the prison to save him.

9
00:00:58,500 --> 00:00:59,430
Fifteen minutes.

10
00:00:59,430 --> 00:01:00,730
Whether we succeed or not,

11
00:01:00,730 --> 00:01:02,930
we meet at the secret passage entrance.

12
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:06,800
Who's there?

13
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,300
It's just a bird.

14
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:22,300
Don't make a fuss.

15
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:23,500
Let's go check the south.

16
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:26,830
I heard the God of War Baili broke into the South Heaven Gate.

17
00:01:39,259 --> 00:01:40,100
You can't do anything right,

18
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:41,229
but you're good at ruining things.

19
00:01:41,229 --> 00:01:42,460
If you make another mistake,

20
00:01:42,460 --> 00:01:43,900
you'll be punished when we get back.

21
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:44,630
Action.

22
00:01:44,630 --> 00:01:45,430
Okay.

23
00:01:59,430 --> 00:02:01,290
You're protecting him like this?

24
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:02,960
He's a demon bastard.

25
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:05,160
What kind of spell did he cast on you?

26
00:02:05,430 --> 00:02:06,960
It doesn't matter who he is.

27
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:08,330
He is my husband.

28
00:02:08,930 --> 00:02:10,560
I'll be wherever he is.

29
00:02:18,060 --> 00:02:20,329
Cangyuan has been lying to you from the beginning.

30
00:02:20,329 --> 00:02:21,660
He's just like me.

31
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,760
All he wants is your power.

32
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,160
If you listen to me

33
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:26,730
and stay by my side,

34
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:28,960
I can pretend none of this ever happened

35
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:30,690
and let bygones be bygones.

36
00:02:30,829 --> 00:02:33,230
The power of the ancient divine vein is unfathomable.

37
00:02:33,230 --> 00:02:35,160
If Cangyuan and Baili join forces,

38
00:02:35,230 --> 00:02:37,630
our position in the Heaven Realm will be in jeopardy.

39
00:02:37,630 --> 00:02:39,430
We must not let them be together.

40
00:02:39,930 --> 00:02:42,800
Compared to someone who cut off our 300-year relationship just like that,

41
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:44,130
pulled out my divine bone with his own hands,

42
00:02:44,130 --> 00:02:46,230
and threw me to the Demon Realm to feed the demons,

43
00:02:46,230 --> 00:02:47,630
his sweet words

44
00:02:47,829 --> 00:02:49,430
at least didn't want my life.

45
00:02:51,329 --> 00:02:51,930
Good.

46
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:53,260
Very good.

47
00:02:53,930 --> 00:02:55,660
Since you insist on saving him,

48
00:02:55,730 --> 00:02:57,000
I'll give you a chance.

49
00:02:57,630 --> 00:03:00,160
Stay and be my Heavenly Empress.

50
00:03:00,930 --> 00:03:03,060
The wedding we didn't finish 300 years ago,

51
00:03:03,060 --> 00:03:04,400
I'll make it up to you.

52
00:03:04,900 --> 00:03:06,760
The Six Realms will celebrate together.

53
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:08,560
It will be infinitely glorious.

54
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,160
As long as you agree,

55
00:03:10,330 --> 00:03:13,560
I'll let Cangyuan return to the Demon Realm safely on the day of the wedding,

56
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,090
and let bygones be bygones.

57
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:16,900
If you don't agree,

58
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:19,100
with the 72 punishments in the Heavenly Prison,

59
00:03:19,100 --> 00:03:20,500
he won't last three days.

60
00:03:20,829 --> 00:03:22,160
Will you choose his life

61
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,600
or your freedom?

62
00:03:23,829 --> 00:03:24,800
You choose.

63
00:03:30,300 --> 00:03:32,329
The secret guards should have entered the Heavenly Prison by now.

64
00:03:32,329 --> 00:03:33,900
They still need a little time.

65
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:34,829
For now,

66
00:03:34,829 --> 00:03:36,490
I have to stall Zhaohan first.

67
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:37,630
I promise you.

68
00:03:37,660 --> 00:03:38,900
But I have a condition.

69
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:40,260
The wedding will be in three days.

70
00:03:40,260 --> 00:03:41,160
On the day of the ceremony,

71
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:42,660
you must let him leave safely

72
00:03:42,660 --> 00:03:44,160
and send someone to escort him back to the Demon Realm.

73
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:45,400
If he loses half a hair,

74
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,400
I won't marry you.

75
00:03:46,900 --> 00:03:48,800
Okay, I promise you.

76
00:03:49,300 --> 00:03:50,500
It's a pity, Baili.

77
00:03:50,900 --> 00:03:52,600
I will never let Cangyuan go.

78
00:03:52,829 --> 00:03:54,829
As for you, I will keep you too.

79
00:03:56,260 --> 00:03:57,460
All of you, step down.

80
00:04:08,330 --> 00:04:11,460
Let's go. Zhaohua Hall is ready for you.

81
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:14,660
Rest well and wait for the wedding these three days.

82
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,330
Cangyuan,

83
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:24,960
wait a little longer.

84
00:04:29,430 --> 00:04:30,830
They call it settling down,

85
00:04:30,830 --> 00:04:32,630
but it's actually house arrest.

86
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:42,530
Cangyuan, hold on for a few more days.

87
00:04:42,860 --> 00:04:44,390
I will definitely save you.

88
00:05:15,430 --> 00:05:17,260
Congratulations, Emperor.

89
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:19,430
Blessed by heaven with a good marriage,

90
00:05:19,430 --> 00:05:21,700
may the Three Realms be forever peaceful.

91
00:05:21,700 --> 00:05:23,400
Congratulations, Emperor.

92
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:25,630
Blessed by heaven with a good marriage,

93
00:05:25,630 --> 00:05:27,330
may the Three Realms be forever peaceful.
